{"id":"dc4893716b639435","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-max.md","title":"最大元 max","display":"df-max — 最大元 max","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-max","aliases":["29-df-max"],"display":"df-max — 最大元 max","depends_on":[],"revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-max"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-max</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-max — 最大元 max"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\([n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> 是自然数上的非严格序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{max}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{max}_n\\)</span> 是以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 为参数的自然数族；本条不重新定义一般集合上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\">\\(\\max\\)</span> 运算，也不预设任何结构中的同名常量解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 仅用于存在唯一见证的定描述。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\exists!a\\in[n]\\;\\forall b\\in[n]\\;(b\\leq a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\exists!a\\in[n]\\;\\forall b\\in[n]\\;(b\\leq a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{max}_n\\coloneqq\\iota a\\in[n]\\;\\forall b\\in[n]\\;(b\\leq a),\\qquad\\operatorname{max}_n=n-1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{max}_n\\coloneqq\\iota a\\in[n]\\;\\forall b\\in[n]\\;(b\\leq a),\\qquad\\operatorname{max}_n=n-1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条保留原文件所取的标准非空数值域；下标避免把不同域大小下的最大元混成同一个无参数对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{max}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\max","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\exists!a\\in[n]\\;\\forall b\\in[n]\\;(b\\leq a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{max}_n\\coloneqq\\iota a\\in[n]\\;\\forall b\\in[n]\\;(b\\leq a),\\qquad\\operatorname{max}_n=n-1.","display":true}],"bytes":1182,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-max]]、[[29-df-quantifier-rank]]、[[29-df-string-structures]]、[[29-df-computability]]：显式参数、类型与缺失别名。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-max]]"}],"outgoing":[]}